<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<ModMetaData>
    <name>Harvest Everything + Tails</name>
    <author>Ykara (Updated for 1.1 by Ogliss); tails by Espio Idsavant; 1.7 fork: Cupears</author>
    <packageId>cupears.harvesteverythingtails</packageId>
    <description>Harvest and transplant natural body parts across compatible humanoid races, including natural tails. Also adds a separate "butcher for animal parts" bill that trades meat for animal organs. Includes the former Harvest All The Tails content: tail harvesting, tail installation, and per-race tail support. Supports RimWorld 1.6 and 1.7. Maintained fork by Cupears. See README and RACE-COVERAGE.md for the supported race list and load order. Requires Harmony. Works with Bionic Icons to show body-part icons on recovered items. Bionic Icons is optional. Humanoid Alien Races and tailed-race mods are optional, not required: tails only appear for races that are installed. Cannot be used with the original Harvest Everything, Harvest Kurin Tails, or any earlier Harvest Everything / Harvest All The Tails copy.</description>
    <supportedVersions>
        <li>1.6</li>
        <li>1.7</li>
    </supportedVersions>
